---
// About Mission section — white background
---

<section id="about-mission" class="w-full py-[100px] bg-white">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="max-w-[860px] mx-auto">

      <!-- Section Heading -->
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2
          class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-[28px] mb-6"
          style="color: #2A2A2A; font-variant: small-caps; letter-spacing: 0.05em;"
        >
          THE MISSION
        </h2>
        <!-- Diamond Ornament -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
          <div class="h-px w-[120px]" style="background-color: #766B58; opacity: 0.7;"></div>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none">
            <rect x="9" y="0" width="9" height="9" transform="rotate(45 9 0)" fill="#766B58" opacity="0.85"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="h-px w-[120px]" style="background-color: #766B58; opacity: 0.7;"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- First paragraph with drop-cap D -->
      <p
        class="font-merriweather text-[18px] leading-[32px] mb-8 overflow-hidden"
        style="color: #2A2A2A;"
      >
        <span
          class="float-left font-bold mr-3 leading-[56px]"
          style="font-family: Merriweather, serif; font-size: 72px; color: #91836C; line-height: 0.9; margin-top: 8px;"
        >D</span>na Digital Consultancy is a specialized boutique practice founded on the principle that digital systems must be engineered with the same rigor as the physical structures they support. We do
        <em class="italic font-semibold"> not "build software"; we engineer outcomes.</em>
      </p>

      <!-- Pull Quote -->
      <blockquote
        class="clear-both font-merriweather font-semibold italic leading-[1.45] mb-10 pl-6"
        style="font-size: 26px; color: #2A2A2A; border-left: 4px solid #91836C;"
      >
        "We do not build software; we engineer outcomes."
      </blockquote>

      <!-- Body paragraphs -->
      <div
        class="space-y-6 font-merriweather text-[17px] leading-[30px]"
        style="color: #2A2A2A;"
      >
        <p>
          For more than three decades, our work has lived at the intersection of business logic and complex system architecture — the Junction where decisions have consequences, and where structural integrity determines whether a system thrives or collapses under real-world pressure.
        </p>
        <p>
          In an era of rapid AI acceleration and platform sprawl, we serve as the architectural guardrail—building digital systems that endure and transforming legacy complexity into modern competitive advantage.
        </p>
        <p class="font-semibold italic">
          Every consultancy claims principles. We operate by doctrine.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA Button -->
      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <a
          href="#contact"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-montserrat font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] uppercase px-10 py-[14px] transition-all duration-300"
          style="font-size: 13px; background-color: #683547; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.12em;"
          onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#7a3f55'"
          onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#683547'"
        >
          Initiate a Strategic Review
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
